      "message": "nit: This comment is slightly ambiguous, and I initially read it as \"this is the same as constructing a matrix from the scalar\", which is only sort-of correct.\n\nFor square matrices you can think of it as constructing a scale matrix using [matrix(scalar)], but that model breaks down once the matrix isn\u0027t square. I guess I find it easier to just always explain that [matrix OP scalar] is a component-wise operation?",
